{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">**About this demo version**</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a demo version of our desktop companion application.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this version, you can experience the following features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- A black cat that freely roams and interacts with your mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Real-time weather updates displayed on your desktop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Pinball minigame where you can collect score and win items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Up to 20 collectible digital paintings to decorate your desktop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Summon idle friends to appear and hang out on your screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This version is designed to give you a glimpse of the final product's interactive features and visual style. It runs independently as a desktop overlay, providing a playful and artistic companion to your daily workspace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo contains limited content and may not reflect the final experience.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3582040?t=1744344007","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3582040?t=1744344007","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582040/70c0bbb83f25705de62162fdc39360294e907bd5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744344007","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582040/70c0bbb83f25705de62162fdc39360294e907bd5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744344007","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">**About this demo version**</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a demo version of our desktop companion application.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this version, you can experience the following features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- A black cat that freely roams and interacts with your mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Real-time weather updates displayed on your desktop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Pinball minigame where you can collect score and win items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Up to 20 collectible digital paintings to decorate your desktop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Summon idle friends to appear and hang out on your screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This version is designed to give you a glimpse of the final product's interactive features and visual style. It runs independently as a desktop overlay, providing a playful and artistic companion to your daily workspace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo contains limited content and may not reflect the final experience.</p>","developers":["Dasusu"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3581810","name":"Desktop Cat"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582040/5c1d5cf9046bc9a4da5efb8f1c967f16e7b3ed43/header.jpg?t=1744344007","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257121699,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257121699/movie480.mp4?t=1744344005","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257121699/movie_max.mp4?t=1744344005"},"name":"DesktopCat_Demo","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257121699/77cd9b4fe27352fd27bdf099cd0553e0c4ff941e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744344005","webm":{